«
@@ ============================================================
@@ FPlan — flight plan along the route, leg by leg.
@@
@@ Input:  TAS FFR wind — the true airspeed (knots if a plain number),
@@         the fuel flow (per hour if a plain number, for instance
@@         12_gal/h), and the wind, either one { WD WS } for the whole
@@         route or a list with one { WD WS } per leg; WD is where the
@@         wind comes from (degrees if a plain number), WS its speed
@@         (knots if a plain number).
@@ Output: a list with one { "A→B" D TC TH GS ETE fuel } list per leg,
@@         then the totals Dist, ETE and Fuel, tagged.
@@ The route is the variable Route, as for WPLegs. Distances and
@@ courses are along the WGS-84 ellipsoid (VincentyInv); the wind is
@@ corrected on the mean course of each leg, the average of its
@@ initial and final courses, which change along a long leg.
@@ Angle mode and angle units setting are restored before returning.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ ============================================================

  'AngleMode' RCL 'SetAngleUnits' RCL
  RAD NoAngleUnits
  → tas ffr wnd amode aunits
  «
    tas IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_knot CONVERT UVAL END
    ffr IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_h * END
    'Route' RCL
    → vt fph rtl
    «
      { } 0 0 0 fph *
      1 rtl SIZE 1 - FOR ii
        rtl ii GET LIST→ DROP
        rtl ii 1 + GET LIST→ DROP
        IF wnd 1 GET TypeName "list" == THEN wnd ii GET ELSE wnd END
        LIST→ DROP
        → nma p1 q1 nb p2 q2 wdr wsr
        «
          wdr IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_° CONVERT UVAL END
          wsr IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_knot CONVERT UVAL END
          p1 q1 p2 q2 ⓁVincentyInv
          → wdd wsk dst az1 az2
          «
            dst 1_nmi CONVERT UVAL
            az1 1_° CONVERT UVAL
            az2 1_° CONVERT UVAL
            → dn a1 a2
            «
              a2 a1 - 540 + 360 MOD 180 - 2 / a1 + 360 MOD
              → tcm
              «
                wdd tcm - Ⓒπ →Num * 180 /
                → dlt
                «
                  wsk vt / dlt SIN *
                  → swc
                  «
                    IF swc ABS 1 ≥ THEN
                      "FPlan: wind too strong for this airspeed" DOERR
                    END
                    swc ASIN 180 * Ⓒπ →Num /
                    vt 1 swc SQ - √ * wsk dlt COS * -
                    → wca gs
                    «
                      dn gs /
                      → th
                      «
                        nma "→" + nb +
                        dn 1_nmi *
                        tcm 1_° *
                        tcm wca + 360 MOD 1_° *
                        gs 1_knot *
                        th 1_h *
                        th fph *
                        7 →LIST
                        → leg
                        «
                          th fph * +
                          ROT dn + ROT th + ROT
                          4 ROLL leg 1 →LIST + 4 ROLLD
                        »
                      »
                    »
                  »
                »
              »
            »
          »
        »
      NEXT
      → dsum tsum fsum
      «
        dsum 1_nmi * "Dist" →TAG
        tsum 1_h * "ETE" →TAG
        fsum "Fuel" →TAG
      »
    »
    amode EVAL IF aunits THEN SetAngleUnits ELSE NoAngleUnits END
  »
»
